# Windsurf rules: data-pipeline

## Setup
- Python 3.12, managed with uv.
- Install: uv sync
- Run a job: uv run python -m pipeline.run

## Packages
- Install only from the default PyPI index (https://pypi.org/simple).
- Pin every version; do not add private indexes without review.

## Testing
- uv run pytest
- Keep coverage above 85 percent.
